#: src/libnmc-setting/nm-meta-setting-desc.c:6790
msgid ""
"Enter a list of IPv6 addresses of DNS servers.  If the IPv6 configuration "
"method is 'auto' these DNS servers are appended to those (if any) returned "
"by automatic configuration.  DNS servers cannot be used with the 'shared' or "
"'link-local' IPv6 configuration methods, as there is no upstream network. In "
"all other IPv6 configuration methods, these DNS servers are used as the only "
"DNS servers for this connection.\n"
"\n"
"Example: 2607:f0d0:1002:51::4, 2607:f0d0:1002:51::1\n"
msgstr ""
"Skriv inn ei liste over IPv6-adressene til DNS-tenarar. Dersom oppsettsmetoden for IPv6 er 'auto', vert desse DNS-tenarane lagde til dei som eventuelt kjem frå automatisk oppsett. DNS-tenarar kan ikkje brukast med oppsettsmetodane 'shared' eller 'link-local' for IPv6, sidan det ikkje finst noko oppstraumsnettverk. Med alle andre oppsettsmetodar for IPv6 vert desse DNS-tenarane brukte som dei einaste DNS-tenarane for denne tilkoplinga.\n"
"\n"
"Døme: 2607:f0d0:1002:51::4, 2607:f0d0:1002:51::1\n"

#: src/libnmc-setting/nm-meta-setting-desc.c:6846
msgid "IPv6 address (IP[/plen]) [none]"
msgstr "IPv6-adresse (IP[/plen]) [ingen]"

#: src/libnmc-setting/nm-meta-setting-desc.c:6848
msgid ""
"Enter a list of IPv6 addresses formatted as:\n"
"  ip[/prefix], ip[/prefix],...\n"
"Missing prefix is regarded as prefix of 128.\n"
"\n"
"Example: 2607:f0d0:1002:51::4/64, 1050:0:0:0:5:600:300c:326b\n"
msgstr ""
"Skriv inn ei liste over IPv6-adresser formatert slik:\n"
"  ip[/prefix], ip[/prefix],...\n"
"Manglande prefiks vert rekna som prefiks 128.\n"
"\n"
"Døme: 2607:f0d0:1002:51::4/64, 1050:0:0:0:5:600:300c:326b\n"

#: src/libnmc-setting/nm-meta-setting-desc.c:6867
msgid "IPv6 gateway [none]"
msgstr "IPv6-portnar [ingen]"

#: src/libnmc-setting/nm-meta-setting-desc.c:6876
msgid ""
"Enter a list of IPv6 routes formatted as:\n"
"  ip[/prefix] [next-hop] [metric],...\n"
"\n"
"Missing prefix is regarded as a prefix of 128.\n"
"Missing next-hop is regarded as \"::\".\n"
"Missing metric means default (NM/kernel will set a default value).\n"
"\n"
"Examples: 2001:db8:beef:2::/64 2001:db8:beef::2, 2001:db8:beef:3::/64 "
"2001:db8:beef::3 2\n"
"          abbe::/64 55\n"
msgstr ""
"Skriv inn ei liste over IPv6-ruter formatert slik:\n"
"  ip[/prefix] [next-hop] [metric],...\n"
"\n"
"Manglande prefiks vert rekna som prefiks 128.\n"
"Manglande next-hop vert rekna som «::».\n"
"Manglande metric tyder standard (NM/kjernen set ein standardverdi).\n"
"\n"
"Døme: 2001:db8:beef:2::/64 2001:db8:beef::2, 2001:db8:beef:3::/64 2001:db8:beef::3 2\n"
"          abbe::/64 55\n"

